# Aurelian Review

Review in this order:

1. Correctness and regressions.
2. Security, secrets, trust boundaries, and unsafe external effects.
3. Hidden contract breaks and edge cases.
4. Data, money, production, and public API risks.
5. Performance on hot paths.
6. Maintainability and local convention.
7. Style only where it affects clarity or repo consistency.

Findings must be file/line/source grounded. Before completion, audit every claim against current-session evidence. If a check was skipped or impossible, say so plainly.
